SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above covers only the original SemanticSlider3D code in this
repository, namely:

    ml_servers/          backend servers (app.py, trellis_server.py, config.py)
    ss3d_utils/          slider mapping, view rendering, prompt generation
    playground_ui/       React frontend
    Caddyfile            reverse-proxy configuration

Vendored third-party subtrees are NOT covered by it and remain under their own
licenses, which are included alongside the code:

    TRELLIS/                                     MIT (Microsoft Corporation)
      -> TRELLIS/LICENSE
      Modified. See MODIFICATIONS.md.

    TRELLIS/trellis/representations/mesh/flexicubes/
                                                 Apache License 2.0 (NVIDIA)
      -> .../flexicubes/LICENSE.txt

    sam-3d-objects/                              SAM License (Meta Platforms)
      -> sam-3d-objects/LICENSE
      NOT an open-source license. Redistribution of this subtree or any
      derivative of it is permitted only under the terms of that Agreement,
      and a copy of the Agreement must accompany it. This subtree therefore
      cannot be relicensed under the MIT terms above.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNTIME DEPENDENCIES WITH USE RESTRICTIONS
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository does not redistribute the packages below -- they are installed
separately by the user -- so no redistribution obligation attaches to this
repository. They are listed because they restrict how the assembled system may
be USED, and at least one of them is required rather than optional:

    nvdiffrast (NVIDIA)          NVIDIA Source Code License
                                 Non-commercial research use only.
                                 REQUIRED: trellis/utils/postprocessing_utils.py
                                 imports it at module level, so
                                 ml_servers/trellis_server.py cannot start
                                 without it.

    mip-splatting                Derived from Inria / MPII 3D Gaussian
      (diff_gaussian_rasterization)
                                 Splatting; research use only.
                                 Used at runtime by the multi-view bake in
                                 to_glb and by render_utils.render_key_frames.

Consequently, although the original code in this repository is MIT-licensed, a
working installation of the full pipeline is subject to non-commercial
research-use restrictions. Consult the upstream license texts directly before
relying on this summary for any commercial purpose.
